01:04:43.500 --> 01:04:45.300
Like the long snapper fund.

01:04:45.300 --> 01:04:46.133
Right.

01:04:46.133 --> 01:04:47.970
So Andrew, we're gonna
be talking to you about-

01:04:47.970 --> 01:04:49.648
I talked to him about it.

01:04:49.648 --> 01:04:50.481
I told him the idea.

01:04:50.481 --> 01:04:51.450
I said, we've been talking about it.

