01:05:17.822 --> 01:05:20.370
Well the thing that I
talked to him about was,

01:05:20.370 --> 01:05:22.863
he told me this story that he was in,

01:05:24.720 --> 01:05:25.693
when he was in a,

01:05:25.693 --> 01:05:29.280
I think he was in a fraternity
or he went to a party

01:05:29.280 --> 01:05:32.850
