and he did not drink.

01:05:32.850 --> 01:05:35.190
So he said, instead of drinking,

01:05:35.190 --> 01:05:38.490
I'm gonna do the gallon challenge.

01:05:38.490 --> 01:05:39.450
Milk?

01:05:39.450 --> 01:05:41.460
Every time you drink alcohol,

01:05:41.460 --> 01:05:43.170
I'm gonna drink milk

01:05:43.170 --> 01:05:45.330
