01:05:47.550 --> 01:05:48.383
Right.

01:05:48.383 --> 01:05:49.830
And I'm not condoning
for anyone to do that

01:05:49.830 --> 01:05:51.390
cuz I don't know what
it does to your body,

01:05:51.390 --> 01:05:52.980
but apparently at a certain point-

01:05:52.980 --> 01:05:53.880
Milk does a body good.

01:05:53.880 --> 01:05:55.380
I remember Jason Batson,

01:05:55.380 --> 01:05:56.213
I told him this,

01:05:56.213 --> 01:06:00.180
I was like when we were in
