01:06:22.667 --> 01:06:25.125
Much like the gallon challenge,

01:06:25.125 --> 01:06:30.125
he just upchucked everywhere.

01:06:30.861 --> 01:06:32.070
He was embarrassed.

01:06:32.070 --> 01:06:34.080
Listen, I don't even think
he got into double digits.

01:06:34.080 --> 01:06:35.458
Oh my gosh, he was bad.

01:06:35.458 --> 01:06:38.280
It ended quick for him.

01:06:38.280 --> 01:06:42.330
So he told me that, yeah,
he went to this party,

01:06:42.330 --> 01:06:45.120
he went to this frat party
after he had been like

01:06:45.120 --> 01:06:47.610
