01:06:49.080 --> 01:06:50.520
he had to run to the bathroom.

01:06:50.520 --> 01:06:51.353
And he said that like,

01:06:51.353 --> 01:06:52.740
it was one of those things that's like

01:06:52.740 --> 01:06:54.720
you know you're getting to the door

01:06:54.720 --> 01:06:56.730
