everywhere in this house.

01:07:02.430 --> 01:07:06.450
He's like you wonder how
it just gets everywhere.

01:07:06.450 --> 01:07:08.670
Like how somebody just
totally destroys a bathroom.

01:07:08.670 --> 01:07:11.160
It's like well I know
because I was that guy.

01:07:11.160 --> 01:07:13.230
And I was like, and then how
long did you spend in there

01:07:13.230 --> 01:07:14.730
just trying to clean it up.

01:07:14.730 --> 01:07:16.600
He was like, no time at all.

01:07:16.600 --> 01:07:17.866
Yeah, you gotta leave.

01:07:17.866 --> 01:07:18.930
You gotta get outta there.

01:07:18.930 --> 01:07:21.360
So then I told him my
story of like, when we were

01:07:21.360 --> 01:07:24.754
in Park City and we met
our high school friend Eric

01:07:24.754 --> 01:07:28.530
and I'm really developing
a reputation here.

01:07:28.530 --> 01:07:29.703
I don't really drink that much,

01:07:29.703 --> 01:07:33.420
but when I do, I really
have a story to tell.

01:07:33.420 --> 01:07:34.320
I don't really drink that much,

01:07:34.320 --> 01:07:35.658
but when I drink, I drink that much.

01:07:38.011 --> 01:07:40.530
I just felt really sick the next day.

01:07:40.530 --> 01:07:43.050
And we sat at this coffee shop
and I was embarrassed to tell

01:07:43.050 --> 01:07:45.540
him that I was hung over
and like the sun was just

01:07:45.540 --> 01:07:47.373
baking in and baking in.

01:07:49.399 --> 01:07:50.520
And at least my recollection now

01:07:50.520 --> 01:07:52.170
is that he ordered some food.

01:07:52.170 --> 01:07:55.140
I think it was a egg, but
I don't know what it was.

01:07:55.140 --> 01:07:56.100
It was a raw egg.

01:07:56.100 --> 01:07:57.360
It was it like a sunny side up egg.

01:07:57.360 --> 01:07:58.677
It made me sick to look at it.

01:07:58.677 --> 01:08:01.560
And I ran to the bathroom and
the same thing happened to me.

01:08:01.560 --> 01:08:03.182
I was like, dude, I know how you feel.

01:08:03.182 --> 01:08:07.770
And then I just hurled
on every vertical surface

01:08:07.770 --> 01:08:08.940
in that bathroom,

01:08:08.940 --> 01:08:13.530
but then I just spent the next
15 to 20 minutes just like

01:08:13.530 --> 01:08:15.060
pulling paper towels out

01:08:15.060 --> 01:08:18.090
and just like mopping everything down.

01:08:18.090 --> 01:08:21.390
And then I come back out
finally and you're like,

01:08:21.390 --> 01:08:22.876
what happened?

01:08:22.876 --> 01:08:23.940
I was like, no there was a line,

01:08:23.940 --> 01:08:26.085
I don't remember what I said,

01:08:26.085 --> 01:08:26.918
but I felt horrible.

01:08:26.918 --> 01:08:27.751
The toilet was going very slow.

01:08:27.751 --> 01:08:28.584
I actually felt better.

01:08:28.584 --> 01:08:29.417
That's what I talked to him about.

01:08:29.417 --> 01:08:30.933
So no real long snapping.

01:08:32.146 --> 01:08:36.123
I asked him at one point if
he was ever in the Olympics.

01:08:37.200 --> 01:08:38.033
He said, no.

01:08:38.033 --> 01:08:39.410
And I just gave him a hard time.

01:08:39.410 --> 01:08:40.243
I don't know if I-

01:08:40.243 --> 01:08:42.300
He was like, I played in the NFL.

01:08:42.300 --> 01:08:45.300
I was like, yeah but you
weren't on a Wheaties box.

01:08:45.300 --> 01:08:47.251
