met a gold medalist before.

01:08:47.251 --> 01:08:49.227
She was also on a Cheerio's box.

01:08:49.227 --> 01:08:51.720
And I was like, that's the ticket girl.

01:08:51.720 --> 01:08:56.520
Also let me say that Andrew
and Sean were on our team,

01:08:56.520 --> 01:08:57.900
we divided up into teams,

01:08:57.900 --> 01:08:58.806
and our team,

01:08:58.806 --> 01:08:59.647
first of all-

01:08:59.647 --> 01:09:00.931
Scavenger hunt.

01:09:00.931 --> 01:09:03.090
It was a scavenger hunt and
that involved some athletic

01:09:03.090 --> 01:09:05.400
stuff and I looked at
our team and I was like,

01:09:05.400 --> 01:09:08.580
